# Keep the build context to source only. Host node_modules (Windows binaries,
# pnpm symlinks) must never overwrite the ones installed inside the image, and
# .env / database dumps must never be baked into a layer.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/var
apps/android
apps/api/backup
audit
docs
tests
workspace
old-production-database
deployed-backup-database
infra/backups
*.zip
*.dump
deployment
